OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 6 MAY
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens showcases the
OL,6,     Gbest performances from the UK &
OL,7,     Gbeyond, including works by
OL,8,     GChopin, Avril Coleridge-Taylor &
OL,9,     Gher father Samuel, and Alexander
OL,10,     GGlazunov's 4th Symphony.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GLive from the Chapel of St John's
OL,13,     GCollege, Cambridge, with music by
OL,14,     GMoran, Cecilia McDowall, Howells
OL,15,     Gand Durufle.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Bartok
OL,17,     GBartok recovers from romantic
OL,18,     Grejection. Donald Macleod
OL,19,     Gexplores the life of one of
OL,20,     GHungary's greatest composers, who
OL,21,     Gtravelled Europe recording folk
OL,22,     Gsongs.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
