OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 6 MAY
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: The Insect Singers
OL,5,     GThe Essay revels in the
OL,6,     Gmusicality and din of Earth's
OL,7,     Gloudest insect singers. Cicada
OL,8,     GSummer Song. Celebrated in verse,
OL,9,     Gsculpture and myth - from Japan
OL,10,     Gand China to Ancient Greece.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GThe New Orleans-raised pianist is
OL,19,     Gback with a groove laden,
OL,20,     Gthoughtful release.
